abstract: "Public metadata catalog of Arabidopsis low-pressure and oxygen-related omics, treated single-nucleus comparators and plant reference atlases. Supporting original code is MIT; original documentation and catalog annotations are CC BY 4.0. Third-party sources retain their rights. No biological measurement data are redistributed."
